==Battleground==
*20 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*20 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*20 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 80~120 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,600f</sup>.
**7 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't as bad as it seems, although it will be long.

Money won't be an issue in the stage due to the constant crocos that spawn, so you're free to spam all of your units. For this stage, it's preferable to use tankier units like [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan]] due to the presence of Camelle, while using wave units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Legs]] to get cash as well as chip down Camelle and the Rain Ds in the stage. Once you've killed the Camelle, you can usually destroy the base after, although sometimes you may have to exhaust the 7 Rain Ds in the stage.

While not necessary, any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] Ubers and strong [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless Cats]] will be incredibly helpful in this stage.

